{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>You have increased.</b> They are Judah, who gathered to Jerusalem. The meaning of לו הרבית is 'you have increased for it the joy,' as it is read [as קרי], whereas what is written [with alef] means there was not joy like it, like לא היה פחד (Psalms 53:5)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:56.370533415Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}